---@field languageTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1beta.StringTargetingDimension Optional. The languages to target. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of language. See https://developers.google.com/google-ads/api/data/codes-formats#languages for the list of supported language codes.
