---@field geoTargeting? gcp.unstable.authorizedbuyersmarketplace_v1beta.CriteriaTargeting Optional. The geo criteria IDs to be included or excluded as defined in https://storage.googleapis.com/adx-rtb-dictionaries/geo-table.csv. If unset, inventory will be targeted regardless of geo.

